<title>HONG KONG: BZW sets warrants on Hong Kong blue chips basket.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on Hong Kong blue chips basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Tuesday it will issue 200 million American style call warrants on a basket of four blue-chip stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd	     0.05  shares</p>
<p> HSBC Holdings Plc	    0.025  shares</p>
<p> Henderson Land Development Co Ltd     0.05  shares</p>
<p> Sun Hung Kai Properties Ltd	    0.05  shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$16.223    PREMIUM	 9.14 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.345     GEARING	 5.22x</p>
<p> LAUNCH DATE	 20.MAY.97    LISTING DATE  05.JUN.97 EXPECTED</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  19.MAR.98    PAYDATE	 04.JUN.97 EXPECTED</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$18.025</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH OR PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT AT THE OPTION OF</p>
<p>ISSUER</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
